<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lone Star downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lone Star downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Stacy Jamar downgraded Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc to neutral from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst cut her 1997 earnings per share estimate on Lone Star to $2.00 from $2.05 and lowered 1998 to $2.40 from $2.50, her office said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/4 at 19-3/8.</p>
</text>
